WEBVTT

00:05:27.246 --> 00:05:30.204
and my mother alone was grieving
the love of her life,

00:05:30.538 --> 00:05:31.996
trying to raise three children.

00:05:31.996 --> 00:05:35.871
And the creditors were knocking,
we felt as a family,

00:05:35.871 --> 00:05:42.746
financially and emotionally ravaged. And
I began to spiral down, isolated fast.

00:05:43.996 --> 00:05:49.329
I started to use food to numb my pain,
bingeing and purging,

00:05:50.121 --> 00:05:55.163
refusing to accept the full weight
of my grief. No one knew.

00:05:55.204 --> 00:05:58.246
And in a culture that values
relentless positivity,

00:05:58.621 --> 00:06:00.163
I thought that no one wanted to know.